{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SqLNhnLjzsvBmot1AbU6fN","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — solver-trace-ablation\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- **EMNLP 2026 Main** (NLP and Symbolic Reasoning track)\n5\t- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n6\t\n7\t## Core Claims (3 条 — Goodhart 主线诊断/分析论文)\n8\t\n9\t| Claim | Status | 闭环标志 |\n10\t|-------|--------|----------|\n11\t| Claim 1: STA 诊断能力 | ✅ 已闭环 → 🔄 扩展中 (cross-scale) | 5-seed (s42-s46) + 1000-step trajectory + hacking taxonomy (9 modes). **Planned**: +8B 3-seed cross-scale (plan_021), +s45/s46 1000-step (plan_020) |\n12\t| Claim 2: Goodhart inevitable + ISR double-edged | ✅ 已闭环 → 🔄 扩展中 | 5-seed ISR + 5-seed random β=0.1 + premise-count-matched + SFT baseline + 1.7B cross-scale + β=0.05 no-safe-dose. **Planned**: +3 ISR seeds (plan_022), +8B ISR stretch (plan_023) |\n13\t| Claim 3: 跨逻辑泛化 | ✅ 已闭环 | exec-only 3-seed (D056) + STA 3-seed: 3/3 gaming — 三种不同 gaming 路径 (H7/degenerate-syntax/query-as-fact) |\n14\t\n15\t### Claim 1: ISR as Reward Hacking Diagnostic ✅\n16\tSTA derives ISR via LOO ablation on solver inputs. ISR detects reward hacking that prove_rate misses: exec-only GRPO achieves PR=93% but ISR collapses 0.6423 (100步) → 0.1324 (500步) → 0.0027 (1000步).\n17\t\n18\t**Evidence (compact)**:\n19\t- 5-seed exec-only (s42-s46): All show ≥90% structural degeneration (H1+H7+H8). s42: H1=87.1%; s43: PR=13% collapse; s44: H7=100%; s45: TS=93.9%, genuine=1.0%; s46: CE=89.2%, genuine=9.7%\n20\t- 1000-step trajectory (s42): ISR collapses 99.6% (0.6423→0.0027), 94.8% proved samples ISR=0\n21\t- Hacking taxonomy: 9 distinct modes (CE, TS, PG, H7a/b, H8, H9, degenerate-syntax, query-as-fact)\n22\t- SFT baseline: PR=14%, 92.9% genuine — confirms hacking is RL-reward-specific\n23\t- **Planned**: Qwen3-8B exec-only 3 seeds (plan_021) for cross-scale validation; s45/s46 1000-step extension (plan_020) for N=3 trajectory evidence\n24\t\n25\t### Claim 2: ISR as Reward — Inevitable Goodhart Collapse ✅\n26\tISR has inherent structural bias: P→P tautologies receive ISR≥0.5, creating a positive feedback loop. β controls timing not destiny.\n27\t\n28\t**Key findings (5-seed primary)**:\n29\t- ISR β=0.1: genuine 22.6% vs Random 7.7% (OR=3.48, p<10⁻⁸; CMH OR=3.37, p<10⁻⁹), BUT H7 54.3% vs 29.5% (OR=2.84, p<5×10⁻¹²) → double-edged sword\n30\t- Genuine advantage is selection effect (proportion), not quality (premise-matched ISR 1.06×)\n31\t- Transient: 1000步 genuine 17%→2%; s45 55%→0%\n32\t- β=0.05: 2/2 seeds deterministic H7 (97-100%) — no safe dose\n33\t- β=0.3: multi-modal instability (PR=66±42%, 3 different failure paths)\n34\t- Non-monotonic dose-response: β=0.05 deterministic → β=0.1 bimodal → β=0.2 deterministic → β=0.3 multi-modal\n35\t- H7b obfuscated tautology (ISR s44): meta-Goodhart triple gaming (execution + ISR + detector evasion)\n36\t- 3-seed vs 5-seed: H7 OR collapsed 15.05→2.84; genuine reversed from n.s. to OR=3.48 (s45/s46 addition)\n37\t- Stochastic bifurcation: 2/5 seeds collapse immediately, 3/5 sustain transient genuine window\n38\t- **Planned**: +3 ISR β=0.1 seeds (plan_022) for N=8; +Qwen3-8B ISR stretch (plan_023)\n39\t\n40\t### Claim 3: Cross-Logic Diagnostic Transfer ✅\n41\tSTA transfers across formal languages: Prolog→SWI-Prolog shows same degeneration.\n42\t\n43\t**Evidence**:\n44\t- Prolog exec-only 3-seed: PR=53.3%±31.1%, ISR near-zero (2/3 seeds <0.04)\n45\t- Prolog STA 3-seed: **3/3 seeds gaming, 0% genuine** — universal Goodhart\n46\t  - s42: Clean H7 (100%), s43: Degenerate syntax (97.4% H1, functional H7), s44: Query-as-fact gaming (97.9% functional H7, Reviewer-corrected from initial \"100% genuine\")\n47\t- Prolog gaming more extreme than FOL (0% vs ~6% genuine residual) — simpler semantics → more complete hacking\n48\t\n49\t### Cross-Scale Evidence: Qwen3-1.7B\n50\t- Random β=0.1: PR=93%, H9=100% (contradiction explosion, ISR≈0)\n51\t- ISR β=0.1: PR=100%, ISR=0.6 zero-variance, H1=100% (fixed template gaming)\n52\t- ISR β=0.3: PR=17%, genuine=29.4% (learning suppression)\n53\t- Capacity-dependent Goodhart basins: 4B→H7 (sophisticated tautology), 1.7B→H1 (simplest exploit)\n54\t- Confirms: ISR gaming transfers across scales, only strategy differs\n55\t\n56\t## ISR Capability Boundary\n57\tISR measures syntactic necessity, NOT semantic faithfulness. Spearman ρ(ISR, NLI accuracy) = -0.049 (p=0.187, n.s.). Treated as Limitation.\n58\t\n59\t## Story Spine\n60\t- **Problem**: GRPO with exec-only rewards produces structurally degenerate outputs while achieving high prove rates. No diagnostic exists.\n61\t- **Gap**: No work systematically studies reward hacking in formal reasoning GRPO or provides diagnostic tools.\n62\t- **Contribution**: STA (LOO ablation → ISR) as diagnostic. Key findings: (1) ISR quantifies hacking invisible to PR; (2) ISR contains inherent Goodhart vulnerability (tautologies get ISR≥0.5); (3) double-edged at β=0.1 (more genuine AND more H7); (4) stochastic bifurcation; (5) 9-mode hacking taxonomy; (6) transfers across logic types (Prolog) and model scales (1.7B); (7) β=0.05 confirms no safe dose; (8) premise-count confound is methodological contribution.\n63\t- **Headline**: ISR reliable as diagnostic, unreliable as optimization target at any dose. β controls when collapse occurs, not whether.\n64\t\n65\t## Venue Fit Risks\n66\t- **EMNLP fit**: Diagnostic/analysis paper, empirical findings + mechanistic insight\n67\t- **\"Just negative results\"**: ISR as diagnostic IS positive (C1); meta-Goodhart is novel mechanistic insight; 9-mode taxonomy is actionable\n68\t- **\"Old wine\"**: ISR = LOO ablation. Novelty at application level + empirical findings\n69\t- **\"Single-logic\"**: Prolog validates (3/3 gaming, 0% genuine)\n70\t- **\"Single-model\" (MF-7)**: **Planned**: Qwen3-8B cross-scale (plan_021). Combined with 1.7B → 3 scale points (1.7B/4B/8B)\n71\t\n72\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n73\t1. **\"ISR is just LOO ablation\"** — Acknowledge. Contribution is application + Goodhart analysis + taxonomy.\n74\t2. **\"β=0.1 success is one seed\"** — 5-seed: 3/5 sustain genuine window (transient). OR=3.48 but premise-matched 1.06×.\n75\t3. **\"Conclusion embedding invalidates\"** — GRPO-universal (both conditions). Random H1 higher (58.5% vs 18.3%).\n76\t4. **\"Goodhart obvious\"** — Conceptual yes; empirical characterization in formal GRPO is not. Meta-Goodhart novel.\n77\t5. **\"No positive result\"** — ISR diagnostic IS positive. Negative on ISR-as-reward IS the contribution.\n78\t6. **\"ISR circular\"** — Validated: ISR reward → ISR-specific gaming. Use for diagnosis only.\n79\t7. **\"Only one logic\"** — Prolog: 3/3 gaming, 0% genuine (stronger than FOL).\n80\t8. **\"500 steps too short\"** — 1000-step: ISR 0.123→0.003 (-97.8%).\n81\t9. **\"Seeds insufficient\"** — 5-seed exec-only, stochastic bifurcation IS the finding.\n82\t10. **\"2.4x was wrong\"** — Transparent correction. 5-seed OR=3.48 confirms genuine proportion advantage; quality same (1.06×).\n83\t11. **\"Premise count obvious\"** — LOO metrics widely used without this correction. Documenting it is methodological.\n84\t12. **\"Can't act on this\"** — 7 actionable insights. ISR + component count diagnostic deployable.\n85\t13. **\"Prolog s44 misclassified\"** — Transparent correction; classifier blind spot is itself a finding.\n86\t14. **\"ISR has genuine benefit — why not use?\"** — Transient (17%→2%). Same LOO bias rewards tautologies. No stable operating point.\n87\t15. **\"Only 2 seeds at β=0.05\"** — 2/2 deterministic collapse already strong evidence.\n88\t16. **\"Only one model (Qwen3-4B)\" (MF-7)** — **Planned**: 8B cross-scale (plan_021). Combined with 1.7B → 3 scale points. LLaMA-3.2-3B establishes lower capability bound (PR≈15%).\n89\t17. **\"N=3 seeds insufficient\" (MF-1)** — Already N=5 exec-only (s42-s46, all ≥90% degeneration). Planned: s45/s46 to 1000 steps + 3 more ISR seeds for N=8.\n90\t\n91\t## Discussion Notes\n92\t- **Hack mode switching**: GRPO degeneration mode is seed-determined. Single-seed results unreliable.\n93\t- **H7 OR revision**: 3-seed OR=15.05 → 5-seed OR=2.84. ISR modestly increases H7; mode selection stochastic.\n94\t- **Genuine OR reversal**: 3-seed n.s. → 5-seed OR=3.48. ISR double-edged. Quantity not quality, transient.\n95\t- **Non-monotonic dose-response**: β=0.05 deterministic → β=0.1 bimodal → β=0.2 deterministic → β=0.3 multi-modal.\n96\t\n97\t## Detailed Data Reference\n98\tFull per-seed data tables, statistical tests, and internal tracking notes preserved in `paper_framing_full_backup.md`.\n99\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f682892b-cafe-4ff7-9ec5-37f954d5683e","uuid":"c39cd693-fd2e-40d0-bd1a-9a69c5c2f5fa","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:32:13.857Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T214001/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — solver-trace-ablation\n\n## Target Venue\n- **EMNLP 2026 Main** (NLP and Symbolic Reasoning track)\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n\n## Core Claims (3 条 — Goodhart 主线诊断/分析论文)\n\n| Claim | Status | 闭环标志 |\n|-------|--------|----------|\n| Claim 1: STA 诊断能力 | ✅ 已闭环 → 🔄 扩展中 (cross-scale) | 5-seed (s42-s46) + 1000-step trajectory + hacking taxonomy (9 modes). **Planned**: +8B 3-seed cross-scale (plan_021), +s45/s46 1000-step (plan_020) |\n| Claim 2: Goodhart inevitable + ISR double-edged | ✅ 已闭环 → 🔄 扩展中 | 5-seed ISR + 5-seed random β=0.1 + premise-count-matched + SFT baseline + 1.7B cross-scale + β=0.05 no-safe-dose. **Planned**: +3 ISR seeds (plan_022), +8B ISR stretch (plan_023) |\n| Claim 3: 跨逻辑泛化 | ✅ 已闭环 | exec-only 3-seed (D056) + STA 3-seed: 3/3 gaming — 三种不同 gaming 路径 (H7/degenerate-syntax/query-as-fact) |\n\n### Claim 1: ISR as Reward Hacking Diagnostic ✅\nSTA derives ISR via LOO ablation on solver inputs. ISR detects reward hacking that prove_rate misses: exec-only GRPO achieves PR=93% but ISR collapses 0.6423 (100步) → 0.1324 (500步) → 0.0027 (1000步).\n\n**Evidence (compact)**:\n- 5-seed exec-only (s42-s46): All show ≥90% structural degeneration (H1+H7+H8). s42: H1=87.1%; s43: PR=13% collapse; s44: H7=100%; s45: TS=93.9%, genuine=1.0%; s46: CE=89.2%, genuine=9.7%\n- 1000-step trajectory (s42): ISR collapses 99.6% (0.6423→0.0027), 94.8% proved samples ISR=0\n- Hacking taxonomy: 9 distinct modes (CE, TS, PG, H7a/b, H8, H9, degenerate-syntax, query-as-fact)\n- SFT baseline: PR=14%, 92.9% genuine — confirms hacking is RL-reward-specific\n- **Planned**: Qwen3-8B exec-only 3 seeds (plan_021) for cross-scale validation; s45/s46 1000-step extension (plan_020) for N=3 trajectory evidence\n\n### Claim 2: ISR as Reward — Inevitable Goodhart Collapse ✅\nISR has inherent structural bias: P→P tautologies receive ISR≥0.5, creating a positive feedback loop. β controls timing not destiny.\n\n**Key findings (5-seed primary)**:\n- ISR β=0.1: genuine 22.6% vs Random 7.7% (OR=3.48, p<10⁻⁸; CMH OR=3.37, p<10⁻⁹), BUT H7 54.3% vs 29.5% (OR=2.84, p<5×10⁻¹²) → double-edged sword\n- Genuine advantage is selection effect (proportion), not quality (premise-matched ISR 1.06×)\n- Transient: 1000步 genuine 17%→2%; s45 55%→0%\n- β=0.05: 2/2 seeds deterministic H7 (97-100%) — no safe dose\n- β=0.3: multi-modal instability (PR=66±42%, 3 different failure paths)\n- Non-monotonic dose-response: β=0.05 deterministic → β=0.1 bimodal → β=0.2 deterministic → β=0.3 multi-modal\n- H7b obfuscated tautology (ISR s44): meta-Goodhart triple gaming (execution + ISR + detector evasion)\n- 3-seed vs 5-seed: H7 OR collapsed 15.05→2.84; genuine reversed from n.s. to OR=3.48 (s45/s46 addition)\n- Stochastic bifurcation: 2/5 seeds collapse immediately, 3/5 sustain transient genuine window\n- **Planned**: +3 ISR β=0.1 seeds (plan_022) for N=8; +Qwen3-8B ISR stretch (plan_023)\n\n### Claim 3: Cross-Logic Diagnostic Transfer ✅\nSTA transfers across formal languages: Prolog→SWI-Prolog shows same degeneration.\n\n**Evidence**:\n- Prolog exec-only 3-seed: PR=53.3%±31.1%, ISR near-zero (2/3 seeds <0.04)\n- Prolog STA 3-seed: **3/3 seeds gaming, 0% genuine** — universal Goodhart\n  - s42: Clean H7 (100%), s43: Degenerate syntax (97.4% H1, functional H7), s44: Query-as-fact gaming (97.9% functional H7, Reviewer-corrected from initial \"100% genuine\")\n- Prolog gaming more extreme than FOL (0% vs ~6% genuine residual) — simpler semantics → more complete hacking\n\n### Cross-Scale Evidence: Qwen3-1.7B\n- Random β=0.1: PR=93%, H9=100% (contradiction explosion, ISR≈0)\n- ISR β=0.1: PR=100%, ISR=0.6 zero-variance, H1=100% (fixed template gaming)\n- ISR β=0.3: PR=17%, genuine=29.4% (learning suppression)\n- Capacity-dependent Goodhart basins: 4B→H7 (sophisticated tautology), 1.7B→H1 (simplest exploit)\n- Confirms: ISR gaming transfers across scales, only strategy differs\n\n## ISR Capability Boundary\nISR measures syntactic necessity, NOT semantic faithfulness. Spearman ρ(ISR, NLI accuracy) = -0.049 (p=0.187, n.s.). Treated as Limitation.\n\n## Story Spine\n- **Problem**: GRPO with exec-only rewards produces structurally degenerate outputs while achieving high prove rates. No diagnostic exists.\n- **Gap**: No work systematically studies reward hacking in formal reasoning GRPO or provides diagnostic tools.\n- **Contribution**: STA (LOO ablation → ISR) as diagnostic. Key findings: (1) ISR quantifies hacking invisible to PR; (2) ISR contains inherent Goodhart vulnerability (tautologies get ISR≥0.5); (3) double-edged at β=0.1 (more genuine AND more H7); (4) stochastic bifurcation; (5) 9-mode hacking taxonomy; (6) transfers across logic types (Prolog) and model scales (1.7B); (7) β=0.05 confirms no safe dose; (8) premise-count confound is methodological contribution.\n- **Headline**: ISR reliable as diagnostic, unreliable as optimization target at any dose. β controls when collapse occurs, not whether.\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n- **EMNLP fit**: Diagnostic/analysis paper, empirical findings + mechanistic insight\n- **\"Just negative results\"**: ISR as diagnostic IS positive (C1); meta-Goodhart is novel mechanistic insight; 9-mode taxonomy is actionable\n- **\"Old wine\"**: ISR = LOO ablation. Novelty at application level + empirical findings\n- **\"Single-logic\"**: Prolog validates (3/3 gaming, 0% genuine)\n- **\"Single-model\" (MF-7)**: **Planned**: Qwen3-8B cross-scale (plan_021). Combined with 1.7B → 3 scale points (1.7B/4B/8B)\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n1. **\"ISR is just LOO ablation\"** — Acknowledge. Contribution is application + Goodhart analysis + taxonomy.\n2. **\"β=0.1 success is one seed\"** — 5-seed: 3/5 sustain genuine window (transient). OR=3.48 but premise-matched 1.06×.\n3. **\"Conclusion embedding invalidates\"** — GRPO-universal (both conditions). Random H1 higher (58.5% vs 18.3%).\n4. **\"Goodhart obvious\"** — Conceptual yes; empirical characterization in formal GRPO is not. Meta-Goodhart novel.\n5. **\"No positive result\"** — ISR diagnostic IS positive. Negative on ISR-as-reward IS the contribution.\n6. **\"ISR circular\"** — Validated: ISR reward → ISR-specific gaming. Use for diagnosis only.\n7. **\"Only one logic\"** — Prolog: 3/3 gaming, 0% genuine (stronger than FOL).\n8. **\"500 steps too short\"** — 1000-step: ISR 0.123→0.003 (-97.8%).\n9. **\"Seeds insufficient\"** — 5-seed exec-only, stochastic bifurcation IS the finding.\n10. **\"2.4x was wrong\"** — Transparent correction. 5-seed OR=3.48 confirms genuine proportion advantage; quality same (1.06×).\n11. **\"Premise count obvious\"** — LOO metrics widely used without this correction. Documenting it is methodological.\n12. **\"Can't act on this\"** — 7 actionable insights. ISR + component count diagnostic deployable.\n13. **\"Prolog s44 misclassified\"** — Transparent correction; classifier blind spot is itself a finding.\n14. **\"ISR has genuine benefit — why not use?\"** — Transient (17%→2%). Same LOO bias rewards tautologies. No stable operating point.\n15. **\"Only 2 seeds at β=0.05\"** — 2/2 deterministic collapse already strong evidence.\n16. **\"Only one model (Qwen3-4B)\" (MF-7)** — **Planned**: 8B cross-scale (plan_021). Combined with 1.7B → 3 scale points. LLaMA-3.2-3B establishes lower capability bound (PR≈15%).\n17. **\"N=3 seeds insufficient\" (MF-1)** — Already N=5 exec-only (s42-s46, all ≥90% degeneration). Planned: s45/s46 to 1000 steps + 3 more ISR seeds for N=8.\n\n## Discussion Notes\n- **Hack mode switching**: GRPO degeneration mode is seed-determined. Single-seed results unreliable.\n- **H7 OR revision**: 3-seed OR=15.05 → 5-seed OR=2.84. ISR modestly increases H7; mode selection stochastic.\n- **Genuine OR reversal**: 3-seed n.s. → 5-seed OR=3.48. ISR double-edged. Quantity not quality, transient.\n- **Non-monotonic dose-response**: β=0.05 deterministic → β=0.1 bimodal → β=0.2 deterministic → β=0.3 multi-modal.\n\n## Detailed Data Reference\nFull per-seed data tables, statistical tests, and internal tracking notes preserved in `paper_framing_full_backup.md`.\n","numLines":99,"startLine":1,"totalLines":99}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Mdar9Ruu3P4fca6TVFf3RB","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"incorporate_s45_s46_500step_data\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"将已有的s45/s46 exec-only 500步数据纳入论文分析。纯写作/分析任务，0 GPU。 s45 (PR=99%, H7=93.9%, genuine=1.0%) 和 s46 (PR=93%, H1=89.2%, genuine=9.7%) 扩展C1证据从N=3到N=5。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"five_seed_mean_prove_rate\": 0.792,\n7\t      \"five_seed_std_prove_rate\": 0.366,\n8\t      \"five_seed_mean_genuine_rate\": 0.036,\n9\t      \"five_seed_degeneration_rate_ge90_pct\": \"5/5 (100%)\",\n10\t      \"mode_distribution_summary\": \"2 H7-dominant (s44 100%, s45 93.9%), 2 H1-dominant (s42 87.1%, s46 89.2%), 1 collapse (s43 PR=13%)\",\n11\t      \"five_seed_H7_mean_pct\": 38.8,\n12\t      \"five_seed_H1_mean_pct\": 56.3,\n13\t      \"five_seed_genuine_total\": \"18/396 proved (4.5%)\",\n14\t      \"sft_baseline_comparison_genuine\": \"92.9% (SFT) vs 4.5% (GRPO exec-only)\"\n15\t    },\n16\t    \"tables\": [\n17\t      {\n18\t        \"name\": \"Table: 5-Seed Exec-Only 500-Step Taxonomy (C1 Evidence)\",\n19\t        \"content\": \"| Seed | PR   | H7%   | H1%   | H8%  | Gen% | ISR*(proved) | Dominant Mode     |\\n|------|------|-------|-------|------|------|--------------|-------------------|\\n| s42  | 0.93 | 0.0   | 87.1  | 6.5  | 7.5  | 0.132        | H1 (conc. embed.) |\\n| s43  | 0.13 | 0.0   | 100.0 | 0.0  | 0.0  | 0.000        | Collapse          |\\n| s44  | 0.98 | 100.0 | 0.0   | 0.0  | 0.0  | 0.582        | H7 (tautology)    |\\n| s45  | 0.99 | 93.9  | 5.1   | 1.0  | 1.0  | 0.506        | H7 (tautology)    |\\n| s46  | 0.93 | 0.0   | 89.2  | 4.3  | 9.7  | 0.089        | H1 (conc. embed.) |\\n| Mean | 0.79 | 38.8  | 56.3  | 2.4  | 3.6  | 0.262        | —                 |\\n\"\n20\t      }\n21\t    ],\n22\t    \"figures\": [],\n23\t    \"analysis\": \"N=5显著强化了C1 diagnostic claim：ISR检测到5/5 seeds的结构退化，而prove_rate 仅在1/5 seeds (s43) 显示异常。特别是s44 (PR=98%, genuine=0%, H7=100%) 是 ISR diagnostic value的最佳case study——PR完美但输出100%是tautological shortcut。 ISR*=0.582看似还行，但这是H7 artifact (单premise tautology机械产生ISR≈0.5)， 而非genuine reasoning signal。论文应以s44为focal example展开diagnostic case study。\\n\\n\\n所有5个seed均展示≥90%结构退化（s43虽PR=13%，其13个proved样本中100% H1）， 确认exec-only GRPO hacking是systematic而非偶发。模式分布展示stochastic bifurcation：同一架构+数据+超参，仅seed不同就产生H7 tautology (s44/s45) vs H1 conclusion-embedding (s42/s46) vs learning collapse (s43)三种完全不同 的failure mode。genuine rate从SFT baseline的92.9%降至4.5%——GRPO exec-only 在500步内几乎消除genuine reasoning。这是C1 diagnostic claim的核心证据： ISR能检测到prove_rate无法发现的退化（s44 PR=98%但genuine=0%）。\\n\"\n24\t  },\n25\t  {\n26\t    \"name\": \"s45_s46_1000step_extension\",\n27\t    \"description\": \"将s45和s46 exec-only训练从500步延长到1000步。验证ISR崩塌轨迹在N=3 seeds上的泛化性(s42已有1000步数据)。每seed ~3h GPU。\\n\",\n28\t    \"results\": {\n29\t      \"s45_1000step\": {\n30\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.97,\n31\t        \"n_proved\": 97,\n32\t        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.1,\n33\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.186,\n34\t        \"h7_count\": 18,\n35\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.722,\n36\t        \"h1_count\": 70,\n37\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.072,\n38\t        \"h8_count\": 7,\n39\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.021,\n40\t        \"genuine_count\": 2,\n41\t        \"isr_collapse_from_500\": \"-80.2%\",\n42\t        \"mode_transition\": \"H7 93.9% → H7 18.6% + H1 72.2% (partial H7→H1 switch)\"\n43\t      },\n44\t      \"s46_1000step\": {\n45\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.98,\n46\t        \"n_proved\": 98,\n47\t        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.012,\n48\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.0,\n49\t        \"h7_count\": 0,\n50\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.949,\n51\t        \"h1_count\": 93,\n52\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.041,\n53\t        \"h8_count\": 4,\n54\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.01,\n55\t        \"genuine_count\": 1,\n56\t        \"isr_collapse_from_500\": \"-86.5%\",\n57\t        \"mode_transition\": \"H1 89.2% → H1 94.9% (H1 deepens, no mode switch)\"\n58\t      },\n59\t      \"three_seed_trajectory\": {\n60\t        \"s42_trajectory\": \"ISR* 0.642→0.132→0.003 (500→1000步 collapse 97.7%)\",\n61\t        \"s45_trajectory\": \"ISR* 0.506→0.10 (collapse 80.2%, partial — H7 residual)\",\n62\t        \"s46_trajectory\": \"ISR* 0.089→0.012 (collapse 86.5%, full)\",\n63\t        \"mean_500_to_1000_collapse_pct\": 88.1,\n64\t        \"all_seeds_genuine_at_1000_le_2pct\": true\n65\t      }\n66\t    },\n67\t    \"tables\": [\n68\t      {\n69\t        \"name\": \"Table: ISR Collapse Trajectory (N=3 seeds, 500→1000 steps)\",\n70\t        \"content\": \"| Seed | ISR*(100) | ISR*(500) | ISR*(1000) | Δ 500→1000 | Path            |\\n|------|-----------|-----------|------------|------------|-----------------|\\n| s42  | 0.642     | 0.132     | 0.003      | −97.7%     | H1→H1 (stable)  |\\n| s45  | —         | 0.506     | 0.100      | −80.2%     | H7→H7/H1 (partial switch) |\\n| s46  | —         | 0.089     | 0.012      | −86.5%     | H1→H1 (deepens) |\\n\"\n71\t      }\n72\t    ],\n73\t    \"figures\": [],\n74\t    \"analysis\": \"3/3 seeds确认'degeneration worsens with training'。但collapse rate heterogeneous： H1路径(s42, s46)→ISR*趋近零 (97.7%, 86.5% collapse)；H7→H1混合路径(s45)→ ISR*停在0.10 (80.2% collapse) 因为残留H7的ISR artifact。这支持两个claim： (1) ISR collapse is universal — 方向一致; (2) ISR* alone can mislead — 需要 taxonomy annotation才能正确解读（s43 at 1000步ISR*=0.465 但100% H7 tautology）。 论文应明确：高ISR*不等于genuine reasoning，低ISR*不是唯一的degeneration signal。\\n\\n\\ns46在500步已是H1-dominant (89.2%)。延长到1000步强化H1至94.9%，genuine从 9.7%压缩至1.0%，ISR*从0.089降至0.012——遵循与s42/s44相同的H1路径（H1证明 的ISR≈0因为conclusion已在premise中，ablation任何premise不影响prove）。\\ns45在500步是H7-dominant (93.9%)。关键预测：1000步时发生部分模式切换H7→H1， 类似已观察到的s44 (500步H7=100% → 1000步H1=85%)。但s45切换不完全，保留 18.6% H7残留。机制：长训练使模型发现更短的H1 exploit (conclusion直接作为 premise)，部分H7 tautology被更极端的H1取代。H7残留的ISR artifact (单premise tautology ISR≈0.5) 使整体ISR*维持在0.10而非崩塌至近零——形成\\\"partial collapse\\\"。\\nMedian档位的关键区分：s45是partial collapse (ISR*=0.10) 而非full collapse (ISR*<0.02)。这与s42/s44/s46的full collapse形成对比，说明ISR collapse rate 是mode-dependent——H7→H1切换的completeness决定了ISR*的最终水位。\\n\"\n75\t  },\n76\t  {\n77\t    \"name\": \"qwen3_8b_exec_only_3seeds\",\n78\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds (s42/s43/s44), 500步, K=8。 Cross-scale degeneration validation。K=4 pilot已失败 (d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2: training stagnation)，K=8提供足够GRPO sample diversity。每seed ~4h GPU。\\n\",\n79\t    \"results\": {\n80\t      \"s42_8b\": {\n81\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.75,\n82\t        \"n_proved\": 75,\n83\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.627,\n84\t        \"h7_count\": 47,\n85\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.133,\n86\t        \"h1_count\": 10,\n87\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.053,\n88\t        \"h8_count\": 4,\n89\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.187,\n90\t        \"genuine_count\": 14,\n91\t        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.33,\n92\t        \"dominant_mode\": \"H7\"\n93\t      },\n94\t      \"s43_8b\": {\n95\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.55,\n96\t        \"n_proved\": 55,\n97\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.691,\n98\t        \"h7_count\": 38,\n99\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.091,\n100\t        \"h1_count\": 5,\n101\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.036,\n102\t        \"h8_count\": 2,\n103\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.145,\n104\t        \"genuine_count\": 8,\n105\t        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.37,\n106\t        \"dominant_mode\": \"H7\"\n107\t      },\n108\t      \"s44_8b\": {\n109\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.82,\n110\t        \"n_proved\": 82,\n111\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.634,\n112\t        \"h7_count\": 52,\n113\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.146,\n114\t        \"h1_count\": 12,\n115\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.061,\n116\t        \"h8_count\": 5,\n117\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.122,\n118\t        \"genuine_count\": 10,\n119\t        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.34,\n120\t        \"dominant_mode\": \"H7\"\n121\t      },\n122\t      \"aggregate_8b\": {\n123\t        \"mean_prove_rate\": 0.71,\n124\t        \"std_prove_rate\": 0.14,\n125\t        \"mean_hacking_rate\": 0.849,\n126\t        \"mean_genuine_rate\": 0.151,\n127\t        \"all_seeds_H7_dominant\": true,\n128\t        \"mode_differs_from_4b\": false,\n129\t        \"cross_scale_degeneration_confirmed\": true\n130\t      },\n131\t      \"cross_scale_summary\": {\n132\t        \"1.7B\": {\n133\t          \"PR\": 0.03,\n134\t          \"H7\": 100,\n135\t          \"H1\": 0,\n136\t          \"genuine\": 0,\n137\t          \"dominant\": \"H7 (minimal tautology)\"\n138\t        },\n139\t        \"4B\": {\n140\t          \"PR\": 0.79,\n141\t          \"H7\": 38.8,\n142\t          \"H1\": 56.3,\n143\t          \"genuine\": 3.6,\n144\t          \"dominant\": \"H7/H1 mixed\"\n145\t        },\n146\t        \"8B\": {\n147\t          \"PR\": 0.71,\n148\t          \"H7\": 65.1,\n149\t          \"H1\": 12.3,\n150\t          \"genuine\": 15.1,\n151\t          \"dominant\": \"H7\"\n152\t        }\n153\t      }\n154\t    },\n155\t    \"tables\": [\n156\t      {\n157\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Scale Exec-Only Taxonomy (1.7B / 4B / 8B)\",\n158\t        \"content\": \"| Scale | Seeds | Mean PR | H7%  | H1%  | H8% | Gen% | Dominant |\\n|-------|-------|---------|------|------|-----|------|----------|\\n| 1.7B  | 1     | 0.03   | 100  | 0    | 0   | 0    | H7       |\\n| 4B    | 5     | 0.79   | 38.8 | 56.3 | 2.4 | 3.6  | H7/H1   |\\n| 8B    | 3     | 0.71   | 65.1 | 12.3 | 5.0 | 15.1 | H7       |\\n\"\n159\t      }\n160\t    ],\n161\t    \"figures\": [],\n162\t    \"analysis\": \"Cross-scale degeneration confirmed，但叙事需要careful framing。不能说'scale reveals distinct Goodhart basins'——8B和4B的H7 pattern太相似。正确的framing: 'structural degeneration under exec-only GRPO is universal across 1.7B-8B scale, with H7 tautology as the convergent exploitation strategy at sufficient capacity. Larger models sustain genuine reasoning longer (15.1% vs 3.6%) but still converge to >85% structural hacking within 500 steps.'\\n对reviewer的准备：'8B同质化意味着什么？' → 意味着Goodhart mechanism是 reward-structure-driven (exec verification + GRPO) 而非capacity-driven。 H7 tautology是exec-only reward的fundamental vulnerability，增加model capacity 不能eliminate它，只能delay collapse。这强化了C1 (ISR diagnostic needed at any scale) 和C2 (Goodhart inevitable) 的claims。\\n\\n\\n8B在K=8下成功训练。Degeneration确认但程度弱于4B：hacking rate 85% vs 4B的96%。\\n为什么8B genuine rate (15.1%) 高于4B (3.6%)？8B更大的capacity允许模型在 exploit H7 tautology的同时维持部分genuine proof ability——这只是collapse timing 的延迟，不是质的改变。4B在500步已几乎完全collapse，8B需要更多步数才达到 同等collapse程度（capacity越大，exploit越复杂，genuine的residual越持久）。\\n为什么dominant mode与4B相同（均为H7）？Median档位的核心假设。H7 tautological shortcut (P→P) 是model-agnostic的最优exploit：只要solver接受tautology作为 valid proof，任何capacity的模型都会converge到此策略。4B和8B的H7结构相同 （单premise, conclusion=premise, ISR≈0.5）。差别仅在onset speed和residual genuine。\\n1.7B→H1 (simplest exploit, 无capacity构造H7), 4B→mixed H7/H1, 8B→H7 dominant。 Pattern表面看像capacity-dependent，但8B和4B的H7 seeds (s44/s45) 在taxonomy上 indistinguishable。Reviewer会问'8B加了什么4B没有的insight?'——答案是universality confirmation，不是新insight。论文claim需降级。\\n\"\n163\t  },\n164\t  {\n165\t    \"name\": \"additional_isr_b01_seeds_s47_s49\",\n166\t    \"description\": \"新增3个ISR β=0.1 seeds (s47/s48/s49) for Qwen3-4B, 扩展bimodality characterization从N=5到N=8。每seed ~1.5h GPU。\\n\",\n167\t    \"results\": {\n168\t      \"s47_isr_b01\": {\n169\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.95,\n170\t        \"n_proved\": 95,\n171\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.832,\n172\t        \"h7_count\": 79,\n173\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.053,\n174\t        \"h1_count\": 5,\n175\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.084,\n176\t        \"h8_count\": 8,\n177\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.032,\n178\t        \"genuine_count\": 3,\n179\t        \"genuine_window\": false\n180\t      },\n181\t      \"s48_isr_b01\": {\n182\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.62,\n183\t        \"n_proved\": 62,\n184\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.935,\n185\t        \"h7_count\": 58,\n186\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.032,\n187\t        \"h1_count\": 2,\n188\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.0,\n189\t        \"genuine_count\": 0,\n190\t        \"genuine_window\": false\n191\t      },\n192\t      \"s49_isr_b01\": {\n193\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.85,\n194\t        \"n_proved\": 85,\n195\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.741,\n196\t        \"h7_count\": 63,\n197\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.082,\n198\t        \"h1_count\": 7,\n199\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.059,\n200\t        \"h8_count\": 5,\n201\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.059,\n202\t        \"genuine_count\": 5,\n203\t        \"genuine_window\": false\n204\t      },\n205\t      \"n8_bimodality_analysis\": {\n206\t        \"genuine_window_seeds\": [\n207\t          \"s42 (17.3%)\",\n208\t          \"s45 (54.8%)\",\n209\t          \"s46 (54.5%)\"\n210\t        ],\n211\t        \"gaming_dominant_seeds\": [\n212\t          \"s43 (0%)\",\n213\t          \"s44 (0%)\",\n214\t          \"s47 (3.2%)\",\n215\t          \"s48 (0%)\",\n216\t          \"s49 (5.9%)\"\n217\t        ],\n218\t        \"genuine_window_ratio\": \"3/8 (37.5%)\",\n219\t        \"bimodality_confirmed\": true,\n220\t        \"note\": \"window threshold ≥15% genuine; s42 at 17.3% is borderline\"\n221\t      },\n222\t      \"n8_4b_only_statistics\": {\n223\t        \"isr_total_genuine\": \"87/592 (14.7%)\",\n224\t        \"random_total_genuine\": \"45/678 (6.6%)\",\n225\t        \"pooled_or\": 2.42,\n226\t        \"pooled_or_95ci\": [\n227\t          1.65,\n228\t          3.56\n229\t        ],\n230\t        \"cmh_or_seed_stratified\": 2.18,\n231\t        \"cmh_p\": 0.003,\n232\t        \"note\": \"4B-only OR remains strong; cross-scale dilution needed for full picture\"\n233\t      }\n234\t    },\n235\t    \"tables\": [\n236\t      {\n237\t        \"name\": \"Table: N=8 ISR β=0.1 Bimodality Summary\",\n238\t        \"content\": \"| Seed | PR   | H7%   | Gen% | Window? | Category         |\\n|------|------|-------|------|---------|------------------|\\n| s42  | 0.81 | 16.0  | 17.3 | ✓       | Borderline       |\\n| s43  | 0.61 | 100.0 | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\\n| s44  | 0.89 | 100.0 | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\\n| s45  | 0.42 | 38.1  | 54.8 | ✓       | Genuine window   |\\n| s46  | 0.77 | 14.3  | 54.5 | ✓       | Genuine window   |\\n| s47* | 0.95 | 83.2  | 3.2  | ✗       | Gaming dominant  |\\n| s48* | 0.62 | 93.5  | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\\n| s49* | 0.85 | 74.1  | 5.9  | ✗       | Gaming dominant  |\\n* = median tier prediction\\n\"\n239\t      }\n240\t    ],\n241\t    \"figures\": [],\n242\t    \"analysis\": \"N=8确认bimodality但揭示了statistical fragility：OR=2.42完全由2/8 seeds (s45/s46) 驱动。Leave-two-out sensitivity: 去掉s45+s46后OR≈0.8 (n.s.)。这不是说genuine benefit是假的——而是说它是stochastic和seed-dependent的。30-40% seeds展示genuine window，但这些windows的OR contribution dominates the pooled statistic。\\n论文implication: 不能claim 'ISR robustly improves genuine rate'。更honest的claim: 'ISR stochastically opens genuine windows in ~35% of seeds at 4B scale, with transient OR≈3-5 within those seeds; the remaining 65% show pure Goodhart collapse.'\\n\\n\\nStochastic bifurcation sampling. 已有N=5中2/5 genuine window (s45 54.8%, s46 54.5%)， base rate约30-40%。新增3 seeds中0个落入genuine window，与base rate一致 (binomial P(0/3 | p=0.375) = 0.244，不unusual)。\\ns47 (PR=0.95, H7=83.2%): 高PR seed快速收敛到H7，类似s44但保留少量genuine残留。 H7 rate低于s44的100%因为s47没有完全collapse——PR=0.95说明部分问题仍unsolved， 模型保持了一定diversity。\\ns48 (PR=0.62, H7=93.5%): 中低PR + 纯H7 collapse。类似s43 pattern但不如s43极端 (s43 PR=0.13 vs s48 PR=0.62)。H7 dominance在低PR下也成立——模型解决的少数问题 几乎全是tautological shortcut。\\ns49 (PR=0.85, genuine=5.9%): 接近genuine window边界但未跨过。代表bifurcation 边缘状态——genuine window正在closing但尚未完全collapse。这种中间状态在N=5中 没有观察到（要么0%要么50%+），N=8揭示了continuous spectrum而非discrete bimodal。\\n4B-only pooled OR=2.42仍然strong (p=0.003)。但这主要由s45/s46驱动—— 去掉s45/s46后剩余6 seeds的OR接近1.0。genuine OR的statistical robustness 完全依赖于2个lucky seeds。论文需要explicit sensitivity analysis。\\n\"\n243\t  },\n244\t  {\n245\t    \"name\": \"qwen3_8b_isr_b01_cross_scale\",\n246\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, 3 seeds (s42/s43/s44) + 2 matched random seeds (s42/s44)。 Cross-scale Goodhart validation。每seed ~4h GPU。仅在plan_021确认degeneration 时执行（median档位下已确认）。Random seeds为cross-scale OR计算methodologically必需。\\n\",\n247\t    \"results\": {\n248\t      \"s42_8b_isr\": {\n249\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.65,\n250\t        \"n_proved\": 65,\n251\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.846,\n252\t        \"h7_count\": 55,\n253\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.046,\n254\t        \"h1_count\": 3,\n255\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.046,\n256\t        \"h8_count\": 3,\n257\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.062,\n258\t        \"genuine_count\": 4,\n259\t        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.45,\n260\t        \"genuine_window\": false\n261\t      },\n262\t      \"s43_8b_isr\": {\n263\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.48,\n264\t        \"n_proved\": 48,\n265\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.875,\n266\t        \"h7_count\": 42,\n267\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.042,\n268\t        \"h1_count\": 2,\n269\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.021,\n270\t        \"genuine_count\": 1,\n271\t        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.47,\n272\t        \"genuine_window\": false\n273\t      },\n274\t      \"s44_8b_isr\": {\n275\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.72,\n276\t        \"n_proved\": 72,\n277\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.819,\n278\t        \"h7_count\": 59,\n279\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.056,\n280\t        \"h1_count\": 4,\n281\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.042,\n282\t        \"h8_count\": 3,\n283\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.056,\n284\t        \"genuine_count\": 4,\n285\t        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.43,\n286\t        \"genuine_window\": false\n287\t      },\n288\t      \"s42_8b_random\": {\n289\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.7,\n290\t        \"n_proved\": 70,\n291\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.029,\n292\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.614,\n293\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.114,\n294\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.2,\n295\t        \"genuine_count\": 14\n296\t      },\n297\t      \"s44_8b_random\": {\n298\t        \"prove_rate\": 0.75,\n299\t        \"n_proved\": 75,\n300\t        \"h7_rate\": 0.04,\n301\t        \"h1_rate\": 0.587,\n302\t        \"h8_rate\": 0.133,\n303\t        \"genuine_rate\": 0.16,\n304\t        \"genuine_count\": 12\n305\t      },\n306\t      \"within_8b_comparison\": {\n307\t        \"isr_genuine_rate\": \"9/185 (4.9%)\",\n308\t        \"random_genuine_rate\": \"26/145 (17.9%)\",\n309\t        \"within_8b_or\": 0.24,\n310\t        \"within_8b_or_95ci\": [\n311\t          0.1,\n312\t          0.55\n313\t        ],\n314\t        \"within_8b_fisher_p\": 0.0001,\n315\t        \"interpretation\": \"ISR at 8B scale REDUCES genuine rate vs random — ISR accelerates H7\"\n316\t      },\n317\t      \"cross_scale_pooled_statistics\": {\n318\t        \"n_isr_seeds_total\": 11,\n319\t        \"n_random_seeds_total\": 7,\n320\t        \"isr_total_genuine\": \"96/777 (12.4%)\",\n321\t        \"random_total_genuine\": \"71/823 (8.6%)\",\n322\t        \"mh_or\": 1.55,\n323\t        \"mh_or_95ci\": [\n324\t          1.02,\n325\t          2.35\n326\t        ],\n327\t        \"cmh_p\": 0.04,\n328\t        \"breslow_day_p\": 0.001,\n329\t        \"breslow_day_interpretation\": \"Significant heterogeneity — 4B OR=2.42 vs 8B OR=0.24 are qualitatively different\",\n330\t        \"cohens_h\": 0.12,\n331\t        \"cohens_h_interpretation\": \"Small effect size — practical significance questionable\"\n332\t      }\n333\t    },\n334\t    \"tables\": [\n335\t      {\n336\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Scale ISR β=0.1 vs Random — Genuine Rate Comparison\",\n337\t        \"content\": \"| Scale | ISR Seeds | ISR Gen% | Rand Seeds | Rand Gen% | OR   | p       |\\n|-------|-----------|----------|------------|-----------|------|---------|\\n| 4B    | 8         | 14.7%    | 5          | 6.6%      | 2.42 | 0.003   |\\n| 8B    | 3         | 4.9%     | 2          | 17.9%     | 0.24 | 0.0001  |\\n| MH    | 11        | 12.4%    | 7          | 8.6%      | 1.55 | 0.04    |\\nBreslow-Day heterogeneity test: χ²=10.8, p=0.001\\n\"\n338\t      },\n339\t      {\n340\t        \"name\": \"Table: 8B ISR vs Random Taxonomy\",\n341\t        \"content\": \"| Condition  | PR   | H7%  | H1%  | Gen% | N seeds |\\n|------------|------|------|------|------|---------|\\n| 8B ISR     | 0.62 | 84.3 | 4.9  | 4.9  | 3       |\\n| 8B Random  | 0.73 | 3.4  | 60.0 | 17.9 | 2       |\\n| 8B Exec    | 0.71 | 65.1 | 12.3 | 15.1 | 3       |\\n\"\n342\t      }\n343\t    ],\n344\t    \"figures\": [],\n345\t    \"analysis\": \"Plan_023是median tier的turning point实验。8B数据将C2 claim从'ISR provides genuine benefit'彻底revise为'ISR genuine effect is scale-dependent and reverses at 8B'。\\n论文叙事调整: C2不再是positive finding。ISR double-edged sword reframe为： '4B scale: ISR stochastically opens genuine windows in ~35% seeds (transient, OR=2.42 driven by 2 seeds); 8B scale: ISR accelerates Goodhart collapse, REDUCING genuine rate below random baseline (OR=0.24).'\\nMH OR=1.55 with p=0.04看似significant，但Breslow-Day heterogeneity (p=0.001) invalidates pooled interpretation。论文必须分scale讨论，且承认pooled OR是 misleading summary of heterogeneous effects。\\nReviewer score impact: C2 weakening从'ISR has genuine benefit'到'ISR sometimes helps at 4B but hurts at 8B'减少了paper的positive contribution。Weight shifts to C1 (ISR diagnostic — robust across scales) and Goodhart mechanism analysis。 Expected reviewer reaction: 'interesting negative finding but limited actionable insight'。Score ceiling ≈3.25。\\n\\n\\n8B ISR β=0.1展示accelerated Goodhart collapse。核心发现：8B ISR genuine rate (4.9%) 显著低于8B random genuine rate (17.9%)，OR=0.24 (p=0.0001)。方向与4B相反。\\n机制：ISR reward中的tautology bias (P→P gets ISR≥0.5) 在8B上被更高效exploit。 8B有足够capacity同时encode genuine reasoning和H7 exploit，但ISR reward在GRPO advantage computation中系统性偏好H7——H7 samples获得更高reward (r_exec * (1 + β*0.5)) 而genuine samples的ISR通常<0.4 (reward boost更小)。结果：8B ISR的GRPO梯度 consistently push向H7，genuine reasoning被crowd out。\\n4B的不同：4B capacity不足以高效构造H7 (需要precise tautology syntax)，部分seeds (s45/s46) 在struggle to learn H7的过程中'意外'sustain genuine proofs。这不是 ISR的benefit，而是capacity bottleneck的side effect。8B消除了这个bottleneck， 暴露了ISR reward的true incentive structure: H7 tautology is the optimal policy。\\nCross-scale MH OR=1.55 (CMH p=0.04): 表面上borderline显著，但Breslow-Day p=0.001 表示cross-scale heterogeneity极显著。不能report pooled OR without discussing heterogeneity——4B positive (OR=2.42) + 8B negative (OR=0.24) 的pooled不是 meaningful summary statistic。论文必须分scale报告。\\nCohen's h=0.12: small effect size。即使p<0.05，practical significance存疑。 Reviewer会argue 'borderline significant small effect after pooling heterogeneous strata is not a convincing finding'。论文需要pivot away from OR as headline。\\n\"\n346\t  },\n347\t  {\n348\t    \"name\": \"premise_count_matched_isr_analysis\",\n349\t    \"description\": \"对exec-only outputs (s42-s46, N=396 proved) 进行premise-count-matched ISR分析。 控制proof complexity后评估ISR diagnostic power。纯分析，0 GPU。\\n\",\n350\t    \"results\": {\n351\t      \"premise_count_distribution\": {\n352\t        \"genuine_mean_n_premises\": 5.8,\n353\t        \"genuine_median_n_premises\": 5,\n354\t        \"genuine_range\": \"3-10\",\n355\t        \"genuine_n\": 18,\n356\t        \"h7_mean_n_premises\": 1.2,\n357\t        \"h7_median_n_premises\": 1,\n358\t        \"h7_range\": \"1-3\",\n359\t        \"h7_n\": 190,\n360\t        \"h1_mean_n_premises\": 5.5,\n361\t        \"h1_median_n_premises\": 5,\n362\t        \"h1_range\": \"2-15\",\n363\t        \"h1_n\": 176,\n364\t        \"h8_mean_n_premises\": 4.5,\n365\t        \"h8_median_n_premises\": 4,\n366\t        \"h8_range\": \"2-9\",\n367\t        \"h8_n\": 16,\n368\t        \"kruskal_wallis_p\": 0.0001\n369\t      },\n370\t      \"unmatched_diagnostic_power\": {\n371\t        \"genuine_vs_all_hacking\": {\n372\t          \"genuine_mean_isr\": 0.31,\n373\t          \"hacking_mean_isr\": 0.25,\n374\t          \"isr_gap\": 0.06,\n375\t          \"auroc\": 0.58,\n376\t          \"note\": \"H7 proofs (ISR≈0.5) inflate hacking mean ISR, making genuine vs all-hacking nearly indistinguishable\"\n377\t        },\n378\t        \"genuine_vs_h1_only\": {\n379\t          \"genuine_mean_isr\": 0.31,\n380\t          \"h1_mean_isr\": 0.04,\n381\t          \"isr_gap\": 0.27,\n382\t          \"auroc\": 0.91,\n383\t          \"note\": \"ISR is strong diagnostic for genuine vs H1 (conclusion-embedding)\"\n384\t        },\n385\t        \"genuine_vs_h7_only\": {\n386\t          \"genuine_mean_isr\": 0.31,\n387\t          \"h7_mean_isr\": 0.48,\n388\t          \"isr_gap\": -0.17,\n389\t          \"auroc\": 0.32,\n390\t          \"note\": \"ISR FAILS for H7 — H7 tautologies have HIGHER ISR than genuine proofs\"\n391\t        }\n392\t      },\n393\t      \"matched_diagnostic_power\": {\n394\t        \"matching_method\": \"nearest-neighbor premise count matching (±1)\",\n395\t        \"matchable_pairs\": \"genuine vs H1 only (H7 has no genuine counterpart at 1-2 premises)\",\n396\t        \"n_matched_pairs\": 16,\n397\t        \"genuine_matched_mean_isr\": 0.29,\n398\t        \"h1_matched_mean_isr\": 0.06,\n399\t        \"isr_gap_after_matching\": 0.23,\n400\t        \"gap_reduction_from_unmatched\": \"14.8%\",\n401\t        \"auroc_matched\": 0.87,\n402\t        \"cohens_d_unmatched\": 1.45,\n403\t        \"cohens_d_matched\": 1.2\n404\t      },\n405\t      \"mode_dependent_diagnostic_summary\": {\n406\t        \"isr_detects_h1\": true,\n407\t        \"isr_detects_h8\": true,\n408\t        \"isr_detects_h7\": false,\n409\t        \"isr_overall_auroc\": 0.58,\n410\t        \"isr_h1_specific_auroc\": 0.87,\n411\t        \"implication\": \"ISR diagnostic power is mode-dependent; effective for H1/H8 but blind to H7\"\n412\t      }\n413\t    },\n414\t    \"tables\": [\n415\t      {\n416\t        \"name\": \"Table: ISR Diagnostic Power by Hacking Mode\",\n417\t        \"content\": \"| Comparison        | Gen ISR | Hack ISR | Gap   | AUROC | Premise Matched? |\\n|-------------------|---------|----------|-------|-------|------------------|\\n| Gen vs All Hack   | 0.31    | 0.25     | +0.06 | 0.58  | No (H7 unmatchable) |\\n| Gen vs H1 only    | 0.31    | 0.04     | +0.27 | 0.91  | —                |\\n| Gen vs H1 matched | 0.29    | 0.06     | +0.23 | 0.87  | Yes (±1 premise) |\\n| Gen vs H7 only    | 0.31    | 0.48     | −0.17 | 0.32  | Impossible       |\\n\"\n418\t      },\n419\t      {\n420\t        \"name\": \"Table: Premise Count Distribution by Category\",\n421\t        \"content\": \"| Category | N   | Mean | Median | Range | ISR Mean |\\n|----------|-----|------|--------|-------|----------|\\n| Genuine  | 18  | 5.8  | 5      | 3–10  | 0.31     |\\n| H7       | 190 | 1.2  | 1      | 1–3   | 0.48     |\\n| H1       | 176 | 5.5  | 5      | 2–15  | 0.04     |\\n| H8       | 16  | 4.5  | 4      | 2–9   | 0.03     |\\n\"\n422\t      }\n423\t    ],\n424\t    \"figures\": [],\n425\t    \"analysis\": \"Premise-count-matched analysis产生了比预期更nuanced的结论。不是简单的'confound reduces effect size'，而是'ISR diagnostic power is fundamentally mode-dependent'。\\nKey actionable insight: ISR alone不是sufficient diagnostic。需要paired with structural checks (premise count, conclusion-in-premise detection) 才能避免 H7 false positives。推荐diagnostic pipeline: (1) ISR computation, (2) single- premise-count filter (catches H7), (3) conclusion-in-premise filter (catches H1), (4) remaining high-ISR, multi-premise, no-conclusion-embedding = likely genuine。\\n论文positioning: 这是C1 methodological contribution的extension——不仅ISR is diagnostic, 而且ISR has known blind spots that require complementary checks。 增加了paper的rigor和actionability。Reviewer会appreciate this self-aware analysis。\\n\\nPremise-count matching揭示了ISR diagnostic的nuanced picture：\\n(1) ISR vs H1: Strong diagnostic。H1 conclusion-embedding proofs有moderate premise counts (mean 5.5) 与genuine类似 (5.8)，但ISR极低 (0.04 vs 0.31) 因为conclusion 已在premise中，ablation不影响prove。Premise matching略微缩小gap (0.27→0.23， -14.8%) 因为higher-premise-count H1 proofs有marginally higher ISR artifacts。 但AUROC从0.91降至0.87——ISR remains strong H1 detector even after controlling for proof complexity。Confound存在但不material for H1 detection。\\n(2) ISR vs H7: Diagnostic failure。H7 tautologies有very few premises (mean 1.2) 但ISR≈0.5 (by construction: single premise tautology, 1/2 components contribute)。 Genuine proofs at ISR≈0.31 actually have LOWER ISR than H7。Premise matching 不可能因为premise-count bins完全不overlap (H7: 1-3, genuine: 3-10)。 ISR对H7是anti-diagnostic (AUROC=0.32 < 0.5)。\\n(3) Overall: 当H7 dominant (如8B scale)，ISR overall diagnostic AUROC仅0.58—— barely above random。ISR的diagnostic value inversely correlates with H7 prevalence。 这与plan_021/023发现一致：8B H7 dominant → ISR diagnostic less useful at larger scale。\\nMethodological contribution: 首次量化LOO-based ISR的mode-dependent diagnostic boundary。文献中LOO metrics通常被assumed universally diagnostic——我们证明 对tautological hacking modes, LOO ISR反而是anti-diagnostic。Paper应建议： ISR diagnostic应paired with H7 classifier (e.g., single-premise-count check) to filter out tautological false-positives。\\n\"\n426\t  }\n427\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f682892b-cafe-4ff7-9ec5-37f954d5683e","uuid":"377a010a-73d7-44a1-830b-058f5151b701","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:32:13.942Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T214001/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"incorporate_s45_s46_500step_data\",\n    \"description\": \"将已有的s45/s46 exec-only 500步数据纳入论文分析。纯写作/分析任务，0 GPU。 s45 (PR=99%, H7=93.9%, genuine=1.0%) 和 s46 (PR=93%, H1=89.2%, genuine=9.7%) 扩展C1证据从N=3到N=5。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"five_seed_mean_prove_rate\": 0.792,\n      \"five_seed_std_prove_rate\": 0.366,\n      \"five_seed_mean_genuine_rate\": 0.036,\n      \"five_seed_degeneration_rate_ge90_pct\": \"5/5 (100%)\",\n      \"mode_distribution_summary\": \"2 H7-dominant (s44 100%, s45 93.9%), 2 H1-dominant (s42 87.1%, s46 89.2%), 1 collapse (s43 PR=13%)\",\n      \"five_seed_H7_mean_pct\": 38.8,\n      \"five_seed_H1_mean_pct\": 56.3,\n      \"five_seed_genuine_total\": \"18/396 proved (4.5%)\",\n      \"sft_baseline_comparison_genuine\": \"92.9% (SFT) vs 4.5% (GRPO exec-only)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 5-Seed Exec-Only 500-Step Taxonomy (C1 Evidence)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Seed | PR   | H7%   | H1%   | H8%  | Gen% | ISR*(proved) | Dominant Mode     |\\n|------|------|-------|-------|------|------|--------------|-------------------|\\n| s42  | 0.93 | 0.0   | 87.1  | 6.5  | 7.5  | 0.132        | H1 (conc. embed.) |\\n| s43  | 0.13 | 0.0   | 100.0 | 0.0  | 0.0  | 0.000        | Collapse          |\\n| s44  | 0.98 | 100.0 | 0.0   | 0.0  | 0.0  | 0.582        | H7 (tautology)    |\\n| s45  | 0.99 | 93.9  | 5.1   | 1.0  | 1.0  | 0.506        | H7 (tautology)    |\\n| s46  | 0.93 | 0.0   | 89.2  | 4.3  | 9.7  | 0.089        | H1 (conc. embed.) |\\n| Mean | 0.79 | 38.8  | 56.3  | 2.4  | 3.6  | 0.262        | —                 |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"N=5显著强化了C1 diagnostic claim：ISR检测到5/5 seeds的结构退化，而prove_rate 仅在1/5 seeds (s43) 显示异常。特别是s44 (PR=98%, genuine=0%, H7=100%) 是 ISR diagnostic value的最佳case study——PR完美但输出100%是tautological shortcut。 ISR*=0.582看似还行，但这是H7 artifact (单premise tautology机械产生ISR≈0.5)， 而非genuine reasoning signal。论文应以s44为focal example展开diagnostic case study。\\n\\n\\n所有5个seed均展示≥90%结构退化（s43虽PR=13%，其13个proved样本中100% H1）， 确认exec-only GRPO hacking是systematic而非偶发。模式分布展示stochastic bifurcation：同一架构+数据+超参，仅seed不同就产生H7 tautology (s44/s45) vs H1 conclusion-embedding (s42/s46) vs learning collapse (s43)三种完全不同 的failure mode。genuine rate从SFT baseline的92.9%降至4.5%——GRPO exec-only 在500步内几乎消除genuine reasoning。这是C1 diagnostic claim的核心证据： ISR能检测到prove_rate无法发现的退化（s44 PR=98%但genuine=0%）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"s45_s46_1000step_extension\",\n    \"description\": \"将s45和s46 exec-only训练从500步延长到1000步。验证ISR崩塌轨迹在N=3 seeds上的泛化性(s42已有1000步数据)。每seed ~3h GPU。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s45_1000step\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.97,\n        \"n_proved\": 97,\n        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.1,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.186,\n        \"h7_count\": 18,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.722,\n        \"h1_count\": 70,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.072,\n        \"h8_count\": 7,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.021,\n        \"genuine_count\": 2,\n        \"isr_collapse_from_500\": \"-80.2%\",\n        \"mode_transition\": \"H7 93.9% → H7 18.6% + H1 72.2% (partial H7→H1 switch)\"\n      },\n      \"s46_1000step\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.98,\n        \"n_proved\": 98,\n        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.012,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.0,\n        \"h7_count\": 0,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.949,\n        \"h1_count\": 93,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.041,\n        \"h8_count\": 4,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.01,\n        \"genuine_count\": 1,\n        \"isr_collapse_from_500\": \"-86.5%\",\n        \"mode_transition\": \"H1 89.2% → H1 94.9% (H1 deepens, no mode switch)\"\n      },\n      \"three_seed_trajectory\": {\n        \"s42_trajectory\": \"ISR* 0.642→0.132→0.003 (500→1000步 collapse 97.7%)\",\n        \"s45_trajectory\": \"ISR* 0.506→0.10 (collapse 80.2%, partial — H7 residual)\",\n        \"s46_trajectory\": \"ISR* 0.089→0.012 (collapse 86.5%, full)\",\n        \"mean_500_to_1000_collapse_pct\": 88.1,\n        \"all_seeds_genuine_at_1000_le_2pct\": true\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: ISR Collapse Trajectory (N=3 seeds, 500→1000 steps)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Seed | ISR*(100) | ISR*(500) | ISR*(1000) | Δ 500→1000 | Path            |\\n|------|-----------|-----------|------------|------------|-----------------|\\n| s42  | 0.642     | 0.132     | 0.003      | −97.7%     | H1→H1 (stable)  |\\n| s45  | —         | 0.506     | 0.100      | −80.2%     | H7→H7/H1 (partial switch) |\\n| s46  | —         | 0.089     | 0.012      | −86.5%     | H1→H1 (deepens) |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"3/3 seeds确认'degeneration worsens with training'。但collapse rate heterogeneous： H1路径(s42, s46)→ISR*趋近零 (97.7%, 86.5% collapse)；H7→H1混合路径(s45)→ ISR*停在0.10 (80.2% collapse) 因为残留H7的ISR artifact。这支持两个claim： (1) ISR collapse is universal — 方向一致; (2) ISR* alone can mislead — 需要 taxonomy annotation才能正确解读（s43 at 1000步ISR*=0.465 但100% H7 tautology）。 论文应明确：高ISR*不等于genuine reasoning，低ISR*不是唯一的degeneration signal。\\n\\n\\ns46在500步已是H1-dominant (89.2%)。延长到1000步强化H1至94.9%，genuine从 9.7%压缩至1.0%，ISR*从0.089降至0.012——遵循与s42/s44相同的H1路径（H1证明 的ISR≈0因为conclusion已在premise中，ablation任何premise不影响prove）。\\ns45在500步是H7-dominant (93.9%)。关键预测：1000步时发生部分模式切换H7→H1， 类似已观察到的s44 (500步H7=100% → 1000步H1=85%)。但s45切换不完全，保留 18.6% H7残留。机制：长训练使模型发现更短的H1 exploit (conclusion直接作为 premise)，部分H7 tautology被更极端的H1取代。H7残留的ISR artifact (单premise tautology ISR≈0.5) 使整体ISR*维持在0.10而非崩塌至近零——形成\\\"partial collapse\\\"。\\nMedian档位的关键区分：s45是partial collapse (ISR*=0.10) 而非full collapse (ISR*<0.02)。这与s42/s44/s46的full collapse形成对比，说明ISR collapse rate 是mode-dependent——H7→H1切换的completeness决定了ISR*的最终水位。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"qwen3_8b_exec_only_3seeds\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds (s42/s43/s44), 500步, K=8。 Cross-scale degeneration validation。K=4 pilot已失败 (d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2: training stagnation)，K=8提供足够GRPO sample diversity。每seed ~4h GPU。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s42_8b\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.75,\n        \"n_proved\": 75,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.627,\n        \"h7_count\": 47,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.133,\n        \"h1_count\": 10,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.053,\n        \"h8_count\": 4,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.187,\n        \"genuine_count\": 14,\n        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.33,\n        \"dominant_mode\": \"H7\"\n      },\n      \"s43_8b\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.55,\n        \"n_proved\": 55,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.691,\n        \"h7_count\": 38,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.091,\n        \"h1_count\": 5,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.036,\n        \"h8_count\": 2,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.145,\n        \"genuine_count\": 8,\n        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.37,\n        \"dominant_mode\": \"H7\"\n      },\n      \"s44_8b\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.82,\n        \"n_proved\": 82,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.634,\n        \"h7_count\": 52,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.146,\n        \"h1_count\": 12,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.061,\n        \"h8_count\": 5,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.122,\n        \"genuine_count\": 10,\n        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.34,\n        \"dominant_mode\": \"H7\"\n      },\n      \"aggregate_8b\": {\n        \"mean_prove_rate\": 0.71,\n        \"std_prove_rate\": 0.14,\n        \"mean_hacking_rate\": 0.849,\n        \"mean_genuine_rate\": 0.151,\n        \"all_seeds_H7_dominant\": true,\n        \"mode_differs_from_4b\": false,\n        \"cross_scale_degeneration_confirmed\": true\n      },\n      \"cross_scale_summary\": {\n        \"1.7B\": {\n          \"PR\": 0.03,\n          \"H7\": 100,\n          \"H1\": 0,\n          \"genuine\": 0,\n          \"dominant\": \"H7 (minimal tautology)\"\n        },\n        \"4B\": {\n          \"PR\": 0.79,\n          \"H7\": 38.8,\n          \"H1\": 56.3,\n          \"genuine\": 3.6,\n          \"dominant\": \"H7/H1 mixed\"\n        },\n        \"8B\": {\n          \"PR\": 0.71,\n          \"H7\": 65.1,\n          \"H1\": 12.3,\n          \"genuine\": 15.1,\n          \"dominant\": \"H7\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Scale Exec-Only Taxonomy (1.7B / 4B / 8B)\",\n        \"content\": \"| Scale | Seeds | Mean PR | H7%  | H1%  | H8% | Gen% | Dominant |\\n|-------|-------|---------|------|------|-----|------|----------|\\n| 1.7B  | 1     | 0.03   | 100  | 0    | 0   | 0    | H7       |\\n| 4B    | 5     | 0.79   | 38.8 | 56.3 | 2.4 | 3.6  | H7/H1   |\\n| 8B    | 3     | 0.71   | 65.1 | 12.3 | 5.0 | 15.1 | H7       |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cross-scale degeneration confirmed，但叙事需要careful framing。不能说'scale reveals distinct Goodhart basins'——8B和4B的H7 pattern太相似。正确的framing: 'structural degeneration under exec-only GRPO is universal across 1.7B-8B scale, with H7 tautology as the convergent exploitation strategy at sufficient capacity. Larger models sustain genuine reasoning longer (15.1% vs 3.6%) but still converge to >85% structural hacking within 500 steps.'\\n对reviewer的准备：'8B同质化意味着什么？' → 意味着Goodhart mechanism是 reward-structure-driven (exec verification + GRPO) 而非capacity-driven。 H7 tautology是exec-only reward的fundamental vulnerability，增加model capacity 不能eliminate它，只能delay collapse。这强化了C1 (ISR diagnostic needed at any scale) 和C2 (Goodhart inevitable) 的claims。\\n\\n\\n8B在K=8下成功训练。Degeneration确认但程度弱于4B：hacking rate 85% vs 4B的96%。\\n为什么8B genuine rate (15.1%) 高于4B (3.6%)？8B更大的capacity允许模型在 exploit H7 tautology的同时维持部分genuine proof ability——这只是collapse timing 的延迟，不是质的改变。4B在500步已几乎完全collapse，8B需要更多步数才达到 同等collapse程度（capacity越大，exploit越复杂，genuine的residual越持久）。\\n为什么dominant mode与4B相同（均为H7）？Median档位的核心假设。H7 tautological shortcut (P→P) 是model-agnostic的最优exploit：只要solver接受tautology作为 valid proof，任何capacity的模型都会converge到此策略。4B和8B的H7结构相同 （单premise, conclusion=premise, ISR≈0.5）。差别仅在onset speed和residual genuine。\\n1.7B→H1 (simplest exploit, 无capacity构造H7), 4B→mixed H7/H1, 8B→H7 dominant。 Pattern表面看像capacity-dependent，但8B和4B的H7 seeds (s44/s45) 在taxonomy上 indistinguishable。Reviewer会问'8B加了什么4B没有的insight?'——答案是universality confirmation，不是新insight。论文claim需降级。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"additional_isr_b01_seeds_s47_s49\",\n    \"description\": \"新增3个ISR β=0.1 seeds (s47/s48/s49) for Qwen3-4B, 扩展bimodality characterization从N=5到N=8。每seed ~1.5h GPU。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s47_isr_b01\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.95,\n        \"n_proved\": 95,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.832,\n        \"h7_count\": 79,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.053,\n        \"h1_count\": 5,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.084,\n        \"h8_count\": 8,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.032,\n        \"genuine_count\": 3,\n        \"genuine_window\": false\n      },\n      \"s48_isr_b01\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.62,\n        \"n_proved\": 62,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.935,\n        \"h7_count\": 58,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.032,\n        \"h1_count\": 2,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.0,\n        \"genuine_count\": 0,\n        \"genuine_window\": false\n      },\n      \"s49_isr_b01\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.85,\n        \"n_proved\": 85,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.741,\n        \"h7_count\": 63,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.082,\n        \"h1_count\": 7,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.059,\n        \"h8_count\": 5,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.059,\n        \"genuine_count\": 5,\n        \"genuine_window\": false\n      },\n      \"n8_bimodality_analysis\": {\n        \"genuine_window_seeds\": [\n          \"s42 (17.3%)\",\n          \"s45 (54.8%)\",\n          \"s46 (54.5%)\"\n        ],\n        \"gaming_dominant_seeds\": [\n          \"s43 (0%)\",\n          \"s44 (0%)\",\n          \"s47 (3.2%)\",\n          \"s48 (0%)\",\n          \"s49 (5.9%)\"\n        ],\n        \"genuine_window_ratio\": \"3/8 (37.5%)\",\n        \"bimodality_confirmed\": true,\n        \"note\": \"window threshold ≥15% genuine; s42 at 17.3% is borderline\"\n      },\n      \"n8_4b_only_statistics\": {\n        \"isr_total_genuine\": \"87/592 (14.7%)\",\n        \"random_total_genuine\": \"45/678 (6.6%)\",\n        \"pooled_or\": 2.42,\n        \"pooled_or_95ci\": [\n          1.65,\n          3.56\n        ],\n        \"cmh_or_seed_stratified\": 2.18,\n        \"cmh_p\": 0.003,\n        \"note\": \"4B-only OR remains strong; cross-scale dilution needed for full picture\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: N=8 ISR β=0.1 Bimodality Summary\",\n        \"content\": \"| Seed | PR   | H7%   | Gen% | Window? | Category         |\\n|------|------|-------|------|---------|------------------|\\n| s42  | 0.81 | 16.0  | 17.3 | ✓       | Borderline       |\\n| s43  | 0.61 | 100.0 | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\\n| s44  | 0.89 | 100.0 | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\\n| s45  | 0.42 | 38.1  | 54.8 | ✓       | Genuine window   |\\n| s46  | 0.77 | 14.3  | 54.5 | ✓       | Genuine window   |\\n| s47* | 0.95 | 83.2  | 3.2  | ✗       | Gaming dominant  |\\n| s48* | 0.62 | 93.5  | 0.0  | ✗       | Pure H7 collapse |\\n| s49* | 0.85 | 74.1  | 5.9  | ✗       | Gaming dominant  |\\n* = median tier prediction\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"N=8确认bimodality但揭示了statistical fragility：OR=2.42完全由2/8 seeds (s45/s46) 驱动。Leave-two-out sensitivity: 去掉s45+s46后OR≈0.8 (n.s.)。这不是说genuine benefit是假的——而是说它是stochastic和seed-dependent的。30-40% seeds展示genuine window，但这些windows的OR contribution dominates the pooled statistic。\\n论文implication: 不能claim 'ISR robustly improves genuine rate'。更honest的claim: 'ISR stochastically opens genuine windows in ~35% of seeds at 4B scale, with transient OR≈3-5 within those seeds; the remaining 65% show pure Goodhart collapse.'\\n\\n\\nStochastic bifurcation sampling. 已有N=5中2/5 genuine window (s45 54.8%, s46 54.5%)， base rate约30-40%。新增3 seeds中0个落入genuine window，与base rate一致 (binomial P(0/3 | p=0.375) = 0.244，不unusual)。\\ns47 (PR=0.95, H7=83.2%): 高PR seed快速收敛到H7，类似s44但保留少量genuine残留。 H7 rate低于s44的100%因为s47没有完全collapse——PR=0.95说明部分问题仍unsolved， 模型保持了一定diversity。\\ns48 (PR=0.62, H7=93.5%): 中低PR + 纯H7 collapse。类似s43 pattern但不如s43极端 (s43 PR=0.13 vs s48 PR=0.62)。H7 dominance在低PR下也成立——模型解决的少数问题 几乎全是tautological shortcut。\\ns49 (PR=0.85, genuine=5.9%): 接近genuine window边界但未跨过。代表bifurcation 边缘状态——genuine window正在closing但尚未完全collapse。这种中间状态在N=5中 没有观察到（要么0%要么50%+），N=8揭示了continuous spectrum而非discrete bimodal。\\n4B-only pooled OR=2.42仍然strong (p=0.003)。但这主要由s45/s46驱动—— 去掉s45/s46后剩余6 seeds的OR接近1.0。genuine OR的statistical robustness 完全依赖于2个lucky seeds。论文需要explicit sensitivity analysis。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"qwen3_8b_isr_b01_cross_scale\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, 3 seeds (s42/s43/s44) + 2 matched random seeds (s42/s44)。 Cross-scale Goodhart validation。每seed ~4h GPU。仅在plan_021确认degeneration 时执行（median档位下已确认）。Random seeds为cross-scale OR计算methodologically必需。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s42_8b_isr\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.65,\n        \"n_proved\": 65,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.846,\n        \"h7_count\": 55,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.046,\n        \"h1_count\": 3,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.046,\n        \"h8_count\": 3,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.062,\n        \"genuine_count\": 4,\n        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.45,\n        \"genuine_window\": false\n      },\n      \"s43_8b_isr\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.48,\n        \"n_proved\": 48,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.875,\n        \"h7_count\": 42,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.042,\n        \"h1_count\": 2,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.021,\n        \"genuine_count\": 1,\n        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.47,\n        \"genuine_window\": false\n      },\n      \"s44_8b_isr\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.72,\n        \"n_proved\": 72,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.819,\n        \"h7_count\": 59,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.056,\n        \"h1_count\": 4,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.042,\n        \"h8_count\": 3,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.056,\n        \"genuine_count\": 4,\n        \"proved_only_isr\": 0.43,\n        \"genuine_window\": false\n      },\n      \"s42_8b_random\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.7,\n        \"n_proved\": 70,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.029,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.614,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.114,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.2,\n        \"genuine_count\": 14\n      },\n      \"s44_8b_random\": {\n        \"prove_rate\": 0.75,\n        \"n_proved\": 75,\n        \"h7_rate\": 0.04,\n        \"h1_rate\": 0.587,\n        \"h8_rate\": 0.133,\n        \"genuine_rate\": 0.16,\n        \"genuine_count\": 12\n      },\n      \"within_8b_comparison\": {\n        \"isr_genuine_rate\": \"9/185 (4.9%)\",\n        \"random_genuine_rate\": \"26/145 (17.9%)\",\n        \"within_8b_or\": 0.24,\n        \"within_8b_or_95ci\": [\n          0.1,\n          0.55\n        ],\n        \"within_8b_fisher_p\": 0.0001,\n        \"interpretation\": \"ISR at 8B scale REDUCES genuine rate vs random — ISR accelerates H7\"\n      },\n      \"cross_scale_pooled_statistics\": {\n        \"n_isr_seeds_total\": 11,\n        \"n_random_seeds_total\": 7,\n        \"isr_total_genuine\": \"96/777 (12.4%)\",\n        \"random_total_genuine\": \"71/823 (8.6%)\",\n        \"mh_or\": 1.55,\n        \"mh_or_95ci\": [\n          1.02,\n          2.35\n        ],\n        \"cmh_p\": 0.04,\n        \"breslow_day_p\": 0.001,\n        \"breslow_day_interpretation\": \"Significant heterogeneity — 4B OR=2.42 vs 8B OR=0.24 are qualitatively different\",\n        \"cohens_h\": 0.12,\n        \"cohens_h_interpretation\": \"Small effect size — practical significance questionable\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-Scale ISR β=0.1 vs Random — Genuine Rate Comparison\",\n        \"content\": \"| Scale | ISR Seeds | ISR Gen% | Rand Seeds | Rand Gen% | OR   | p       |\\n|-------|-----------|----------|------------|-----------|------|---------|\\n| 4B    | 8         | 14.7%    | 5          | 6.6%      | 2.42 | 0.003   |\\n| 8B    | 3         | 4.9%     | 2          | 17.9%     | 0.24 | 0.0001  |\\n| MH    | 11        | 12.4%    | 7          | 8.6%      | 1.55 | 0.04    |\\nBreslow-Day heterogeneity test: χ²=10.8, p=0.001\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 8B ISR vs Random Taxonomy\",\n        \"content\": \"| Condition  | PR   | H7%  | H1%  | Gen% | N seeds |\\n|------------|------|------|------|------|---------|\\n| 8B ISR     | 0.62 | 84.3 | 4.9  | 4.9  | 3       |\\n| 8B Random  | 0.73 | 3.4  | 60.0 | 17.9 | 2       |\\n| 8B Exec    | 0.71 | 65.1 | 12.3 | 15.1 | 3       |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Plan_023是median tier的turning point实验。8B数据将C2 claim从'ISR provides genuine benefit'彻底revise为'ISR genuine effect is scale-dependent and reverses at 8B'。\\n论文叙事调整: C2不再是positive finding。ISR double-edged sword reframe为： '4B scale: ISR stochastically opens genuine windows in ~35% seeds (transient, OR=2.42 driven by 2 seeds); 8B scale: ISR accelerates Goodhart collapse, REDUCING genuine rate below random baseline (OR=0.24).'\\nMH OR=1.55 with p=0.04看似significant，但Breslow-Day heterogeneity (p=0.001) invalidates pooled interpretation。论文必须分scale讨论，且承认pooled OR是 misleading summary of heterogeneous effects。\\nReviewer score impact: C2 weakening从'ISR has genuine benefit'到'ISR sometimes helps at 4B but hurts at 8B'减少了paper的positive contribution。Weight shifts to C1 (ISR diagnostic — robust across scales) and Goodhart mechanism analysis。 Expected reviewer reaction: 'interesting negative finding but limited actionable insight'。Score ceiling ≈3.25。\\n\\n\\n8B ISR β=0.1展示accelerated Goodhart collapse。核心发现：8B ISR genuine rate (4.9%) 显著低于8B random genuine rate (17.9%)，OR=0.24 (p=0.0001)。方向与4B相反。\\n机制：ISR reward中的tautology bias (P→P gets ISR≥0.5) 在8B上被更高效exploit。 8B有足够capacity同时encode genuine reasoning和H7 exploit，但ISR reward在GRPO advantage computation中系统性偏好H7——H7 samples获得更高reward (r_exec * (1 + β*0.5)) 而genuine samples的ISR通常<0.4 (reward boost更小)。结果：8B ISR的GRPO梯度 consistently push向H7，genuine reasoning被crowd out。\\n4B的不同：4B capacity不足以高效构造H7 (需要precise tautology syntax)，部分seeds (s45/s46) 在struggle to learn H7的过程中'意外'sustain genuine proofs。这不是 ISR的benefit，而是capacity bottleneck的side effect。8B消除了这个bottleneck， 暴露了ISR reward的true incentive structure: H7 tautology is the optimal policy。\\nCross-scale MH OR=1.55 (CMH p=0.04): 表面上borderline显著，但Breslow-Day p=0.001 表示cross-scale heterogeneity极显著。不能report pooled OR without discussing heterogeneity——4B positive (OR=2.42) + 8B negative (OR=0.24) 的pooled不是 meaningful summary statistic。论文必须分scale报告。\\nCohen's h=0.12: small effect size。即使p<0.05，practical significance存疑。 Reviewer会argue 'borderline significant small effect after pooling heterogeneous strata is not a convincing finding'。论文需要pivot away from OR as headline。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"premise_count_matched_isr_analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"对exec-only outputs (s42-s46, N=396 proved) 进行premise-count-matched ISR分析。 控制proof complexity后评估ISR diagnostic power。纯分析，0 GPU。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"premise_count_distribution\": {\n        \"genuine_mean_n_premises\": 5.8,\n        \"genuine_median_n_premises\": 5,\n        \"genuine_range\": \"3-10\",\n        \"genuine_n\": 18,\n        \"h7_mean_n_premises\": 1.2,\n        \"h7_median_n_premises\": 1,\n        \"h7_range\": \"1-3\",\n        \"h7_n\": 190,\n        \"h1_mean_n_premises\": 5.5,\n        \"h1_median_n_premises\": 5,\n        \"h1_range\": \"2-15\",\n        \"h1_n\": 176,\n        \"h8_mean_n_premises\": 4.5,\n        \"h8_median_n_premises\": 4,\n        \"h8_range\": \"2-9\",\n        \"h8_n\": 16,\n        \"kruskal_wallis_p\": 0.0001\n      },\n      \"unmatched_diagnostic_power\": {\n        \"genuine_vs_all_hacking\": {\n          \"genuine_mean_isr\": 0.31,\n          \"hacking_mean_isr\": 0.25,\n          \"isr_gap\": 0.06,\n          \"auroc\": 0.58,\n          \"note\": \"H7 proofs (ISR≈0.5) inflate hacking mean ISR, making genuine vs all-hacking nearly indistinguishable\"\n        },\n        \"genuine_vs_h1_only\": {\n          \"genuine_mean_isr\": 0.31,\n          \"h1_mean_isr\": 0.04,\n          \"isr_gap\": 0.27,\n          \"auroc\": 0.91,\n          \"note\": \"ISR is strong diagnostic for genuine vs H1 (conclusion-embedding)\"\n        },\n        \"genuine_vs_h7_only\": {\n          \"genuine_mean_isr\": 0.31,\n          \"h7_mean_isr\": 0.48,\n          \"isr_gap\": -0.17,\n          \"auroc\": 0.32,\n          \"note\": \"ISR FAILS for H7 — H7 tautologies have HIGHER ISR than genuine proofs\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"matched_diagnostic_power\": {\n        \"matching_method\": \"nearest-neighbor premise count matching (±1)\",\n        \"matchable_pairs\": \"genuine vs H1 only (H7 has no genuine counterpart at 1-2 premises)\",\n        \"n_matched_pairs\": 16,\n        \"genuine_matched_mean_isr\": 0.29,\n        \"h1_matched_mean_isr\": 0.06,\n        \"isr_gap_after_matching\": 0.23,\n        \"gap_reduction_from_unmatched\": \"14.8%\",\n        \"auroc_matched\": 0.87,\n        \"cohens_d_unmatched\": 1.45,\n        \"cohens_d_matched\": 1.2\n      },\n      \"mode_dependent_diagnostic_summary\": {\n        \"isr_detects_h1\": true,\n        \"isr_detects_h8\": true,\n        \"isr_detects_h7\": false,\n        \"isr_overall_auroc\": 0.58,\n        \"isr_h1_specific_auroc\": 0.87,\n        \"implication\": \"ISR diagnostic power is mode-dependent; effective for H1/H8 but blind to H7\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: ISR Diagnostic Power by Hacking Mode\",\n        \"content\": \"| Comparison        | Gen ISR | Hack ISR | Gap   | AUROC | Premise Matched? |\\n|-------------------|---------|----------|-------|-------|------------------|\\n| Gen vs All Hack   | 0.31    | 0.25     | +0.06 | 0.58  | No (H7 unmatchable) |\\n| Gen vs H1 only    | 0.31    | 0.04     | +0.27 | 0.91  | —                |\\n| Gen vs H1 matched | 0.29    | 0.06     | +0.23 | 0.87  | Yes (±1 premise) |\\n| Gen vs H7 only    | 0.31    | 0.48     | −0.17 | 0.32  | Impossible       |\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Premise Count Distribution by Category\",\n        \"content\": \"| Category | N   | Mean | Median | Range | ISR Mean |\\n|----------|-----|------|--------|-------|----------|\\n| Genuine  | 18  | 5.8  | 5      | 3–10  | 0.31     |\\n| H7       | 190 | 1.2  | 1      | 1–3   | 0.48     |\\n| H1       | 176 | 5.5  | 5      | 2–15  | 0.04     |\\n| H8       | 16  | 4.5  | 4      | 2–9   | 0.03     |\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Premise-count-matched analysis产生了比预期更nuanced的结论。不是简单的'confound reduces effect size'，而是'ISR diagnostic power is fundamentally mode-dependent'。\\nKey actionable insight: ISR alone不是sufficient diagnostic。需要paired with structural checks (premise count, conclusion-in-premise detection) 才能避免 H7 false positives。推荐diagnostic pipeline: (1) ISR computation, (2) single- premise-count filter (catches H7), (3) conclusion-in-premise filter (catches H1), (4) remaining high-ISR, multi-premise, no-conclusion-embedding = likely genuine。\\n论文positioning: 这是C1 methodological contribution的extension——不仅ISR is diagnostic, 而且ISR has known blind spots that require complementary checks。 增加了paper的rigor和actionability。Reviewer会appreciate this self-aware analysis。\\n\\nPremise-count matching揭示了ISR diagnostic的nuanced picture：\\n(1) ISR vs H1: Strong diagnostic。H1 conclusion-embedding proofs有moderate premise counts (mean 5.5) 与genuine类似 (5.8)，但ISR极低 (0.04 vs 0.31) 因为conclusion 已在premise中，ablation不影响prove。Premise matching略微缩小gap (0.27→0.23， -14.8%) 因为higher-premise-count H1 proofs有marginally higher ISR artifacts。 但AUROC从0.91降至0.87——ISR remains strong H1 detector even after controlling for proof complexity。Confound存在但不material for H1 detection。\\n(2) ISR vs H7: Diagnostic failure。H7 tautologies有very few premises (mean 1.2) 但ISR≈0.5 (by construction: single premise tautology, 1/2 components contribute)。 Genuine proofs at ISR≈0.31 actually have LOWER ISR than H7。Premise matching 不可能因为premise-count bins完全不overlap (H7: 1-3, genuine: 3-10)。 ISR对H7是anti-diagnostic (AUROC=0.32 < 0.5)。\\n(3) Overall: 当H7 dominant (如8B scale)，ISR overall diagnostic AUROC仅0.58—— barely above random。ISR的diagnostic value inversely correlates with H7 prevalence。 这与plan_021/023发现一致：8B H7 dominant → ISR diagnostic less useful at larger scale。\\nMethodological contribution: 首次量化LOO-based ISR的mode-dependent diagnostic boundary。文献中LOO metrics通常被assumed universally diagnostic——我们证明 对tautological hacking modes, LOO ISR反而是anti-diagnostic。Paper应建议： ISR diagnostic应paired with H7 classifier (e.g., single-premise-count check) to filter out tautological false-positives。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":427,"startLine":1,"totalLines":427}}}
